# This agent uses rule-based reasoning (see agents/reasoning.py) —
# no LLM API calls are made anywhere in the pipeline, so no API keys
# are required to run it.
#
# This file is included to satisfy the repository template / to make
# it explicit and auditable that no secrets are needed or used.
#
# If you extend this project to Tier 2 with LLM tool-calling, add
# your key requirements here, e.g.:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_key_here
